===== j06_dvfs =====
usage: st dvfs [command]
       st dvfs help
               display help.
       st dvfs show
               show out all dvfs informations.
       st dvfs set a9 <on | off>
               set a9 dvfs.
       st dvfs set isp <on | off>
               set isp dvfs.
       st dvfs vol show 
               show d5 core voltage.
       st dvfs vol set <vddi | a9 | isp> <770 ~ 1100 mV>
               set d5 core voltage.
